{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fce2bd3bdf7f833e76429bd98ce4e53c9289563a4a0f918ac329bff153f5d917", "ja": "（今度の仕事は、アイドル大運動会。琴葉は、未来と\n可奈と一緒にチアガールをやってもらうんだけど……）", "zh": "（这次的工作是偶像大运动会。琴叶要和未来、可奈一起担任啦啦队，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1001_p", "source_sha256": "230fad67f1f47bb89c3dd125cdbe42da1e8a59a54d6d12dbb4edf915a3070b61", "ja": "お疲れさま、琴葉！　今ちょっといいか？\nアイドル大運動会の、打ち合わせをしたいんだけど。", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶！现在方便吗？\n我想和你商量一下偶像大运动会的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "9d878084b5b5e5273a344273dc86c9d6658110063f3738b0d40d317a55964324", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nちょうどよかった。私も、相談があったんです。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n正好，我也有件事想和你商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cce0287993a6416fa1dd0e7a54efe6dd7d20d750fc8eb136c249597fe211486c", "ja": "相談？　何か心配な事でもあるのか？", "zh": "商量？是有什么担心的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "8c51edde72fdebb75143ac6c821176cba6f7d8a7fb8df210785a11a2f8bce352", "ja": "はい。台本を確認したんですけど、大縄跳びから\n次のプログラムが始まるまで、すごく短いんです。", "zh": "是的。我确认了一下剧本，从集体跳绳结束到下一个节目开始，时间非常短。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "4a4adb6ffa0c448bb3ac94ba1d6a74eeba36ad7fd14087c7c28d8819fce01755", "ja": "私と未来、可奈ちゃんの3人は、チアの衣装に\n着替えないとですから。間に合うかどうか……。", "zh": "我、未来和可奈这3个人还得换上啦啦队服装才行。所以能不能赶上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e72be4be2d963697d38505d281d8125a83547beec69d97fb6c84c3400a91dc7e", "ja": "確かに、ちょっと厳しそうだな……。\n進行については、リハーサル前に相談だな。", "zh": "确实，时间上可能有点紧……\n关于流程安排，得在彩排前商量一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1007_p", "source_sha256": "357163d1ec09c28b65db4f88f065093840a31daf370795cdf503f31a476db2c8", "ja": "後は念のために、早替えの予行演習をしておこうか。\n時間内に、衣装に着替えられるかどうか。", "zh": "之后为了以防万一，先做一下快速换装的模拟练习吧。\n看看能不能在规定时间内换好服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "b7bb7cf999e8400863e5c01bb05a315ca38664bb81b380ede6c0ab0219eea862", "ja": "予行演習ですか？\n……。", "zh": "是预演吗？\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "402a5333214c1dacf7d3e3701ef709dceeb864a7ed99727094c396bf0efac1f1", "ja": "琴葉？", "zh": "琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "2ad06b30860a71e4ae20cec84605c4c112232c1c0157795a2684f39fd9becd2e", "ja": "あ、いえ。{$P$}。せっかく\n予行演習をするなら、大縄跳びからやりませんか。", "zh": "啊，不是。{$P$}。难得要进行预演，不如先从大绳跳开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1283a49c76e8650c159d69f26a3b4f22fa67db7398c37c699af5bc1f4a01d201", "ja": "大縄跳びから？", "zh": "从集体跳绳开始？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "cd849619753af09819c4b859e7196f809d2d8370194d4bf7e98fef413f4a08e8", "ja": "はい。当日と全く同じにやってみた方が、\n相談する時にもいいんじゃないかと思って。でも……。", "zh": "是的。我想，还是完全按照当天的情况试一遍，之后商量时也会更好。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "0c1f2455af1a2cead9ba47a438b3490d12e97619917d66b5d35a05d1cd2bc1ef", "ja": "大縄跳びの練習までするのは、\nちょっと、大げさだったでしょうか？", "zh": "连跳大绳都练习，\n会不会有点太小题大做了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7effb248a06754a50f4f26d0769142752e6ca3cf7b054f20d019610525b180de", "ja": "はは、そうだな。ちょっと驚いたけど……でも、\n案外いい息抜きにもなるかもしれないな。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。虽然有点惊讶……不过，说不定意外地能成为很好的放松方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "3ab19573bccb72b2866e6c88abe411649b0797cda7ff19228849cec9008d0440", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます。\nじゃあ私、みんなに声かけてきますね。", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢您。\n那我去叫大家过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1016_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1017_p", "source_sha256": "90f0d5a9ea3fea97313ea7e5e0a57268dfb05f81ac07d7c58c5d5ea7627fd668", "ja": "大縄跳び、みんな楽しそうだったな。あとは時間を\n少し伸ばしてもらえれば、本番も上手くいきそうだ。", "zh": "跳长绳大家都玩得很开心呢。之后只要时间\n能稍微放宽一点，正式演出应该也能顺利进行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "392752ab232a48aadfbce40621e9fe9fda98eb2c7302b2ca7af79640990e4030", "ja": "そうですね。実際にやってみたら、大縄跳びから\n控え室への移動も、スムーズにできましたし……。", "zh": "是啊。实际试了一下，从跳大绳的地方前往休息室也很顺利……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "51d0e8209f65b1a0165a011969282ccf971126efa123452622722de4240e830f", "ja": "予行演習してみて、当日が楽しみになってきました。\n本番も、こんな感じでできたらいいな……♪", "zh": "试着预演了一下，开始期待当天了。\n正式比赛也能像这样顺利进行就好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1020_p", "source_sha256": "02c4fd227084eb21729ec7a22e69736082d5800db7f83987ad9347de78e4e43a", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。怪我なく事故なく、\nいい運動会になるように頑張ろう！", "zh": "啊，是啊。让我们一起努力，举办一场不受伤、不出事故的精彩运动会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0163_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "f969a7ff7339c957752bceb3364568784b35e97aa27747f0db86291e690994f4", "ja": "はい！\nアイドル大運動会、がんばりますね！", "zh": "好的！\n偶像大运动会，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
